1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Why is the quadratic formula true?

2
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:05,040
A square, completed.

3
00:00:05,446 --> 00:00:08,379
Take x squared plus b x, and set it equal

4
00:00:08,379 --> 00:00:08,886
to c.

5
00:00:09,199 --> 00:00:12,799
x squared is a square of side x, and b x

6
00:00:12,799 --> 00:00:16,319
is two rectangles, each b over two by x.

7
00:00:16,513 --> 00:00:19,761
It almost makes one bigger square — only

8
00:00:19,761 --> 00:00:23,043
this corner is missing: b over two,

9
00:00:23,043 --> 00:00:23,393
squared.

10
00:00:23,592 --> 00:00:25,432
Add that corner to both sides.

11
00:00:25,630 --> 00:00:28,350
Now the pieces are one square of side x

12
00:00:28,350 --> 00:00:29,790
plus b over two.

13
00:00:29,992 --> 00:00:32,972
Take the square root, then subtract b over

14
00:00:32,972 --> 00:00:33,272
two.

15
00:00:33,945 --> 00:00:36,665
The same square solves every quadratic.

16
00:00:36,871 --> 00:00:40,711
Divide by a, and move c over a across.

17
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:43,096
Complete the square, gather the right

18
00:00:43,096 --> 00:00:46,200
side, take the root, and subtract b over

19
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:46,840
two a.

20
00:00:47,189 --> 00:00:48,549
The quadratic formula.

21
00:00:49,278 --> 00:00:53,118
Try it on x squared plus six x plus five

22
00:00:53,118 --> 00:00:53,998
equals zero.

23
00:00:54,189 --> 00:00:57,509
The formula gives minus six, plus or minus

24
00:00:57,509 --> 00:01:00,189
the root of thirty-six minus twenty, over

25
00:01:00,189 --> 00:01:00,429
two.

26
00:01:00,615 --> 00:01:04,423
The root of sixteen is four: minus six,

27
00:01:04,423 --> 00:01:08,522
plus or minus four, over two — minus one,

28
00:01:08,522 --> 00:01:09,335
or minus five.

29
00:01:09,444 --> 00:01:12,944
And check it on the parabola: y equals x

30
00:01:12,944 --> 00:01:15,925
squared plus six x plus five.

31
00:01:16,053 --> 00:01:18,840
It crosses the x-axis at minus five and

32
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:19,573
minus one.

33
00:01:20,440 --> 00:01:23,640
That is why it is true: the formula is a

34
00:01:23,640 --> 00:01:26,760
picture — a square, completed.

